            "pdf_page": 70,
            "printed_page": 70
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Life ... life ... for me, who brought a charter of rights, a charter of death? Look, that day you stopped these policemen from arresting me. Today, those same policemen have come to save me from you. What harm have I done to you?",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
